            {
              "id": "art-body",
              "type": "column",
              "props": {
                "span": 9
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "id": "lede",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "If you’re in the market for a <a href=\"/\">new or used International truck</a>, one thing is clear: the dealer you choose matters. Not all dealerships offer the same level of service, product knowledge, or long-term support, and when you’re making a major investment in your fleet, the right partner makes all the difference.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full",
                    "anchor": "post-lede"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-intro-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "At <a href=\"/\">Sun State International</a>, we’re proud to be more than just an <a href=\"/\">International truck dealer</a>. We’re a full-service partner for commercial truck owners and fleet managers across Florida who want trucks they can count on and a dealership that stands behind every sale. Whether you’re buying your first truck or managing a growing fleet, here’s why <a href=\"/\">Sun State International</a> is the dealership you’ve been searching for.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-specialize",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "We Specialize in International Trucks—And We Know Them Inside and Out",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "specialize"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-specialize-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "At <a href=\"/\">Sun State International</a>, we specialize in <a href=\"https://www.international.com/\">International trucks</a>, and that means we offer expert insight into every model, every configuration, and every option available. Our sales team is extensively trained and deeply familiar with the needs of heavy-duty operators, regional haulers, and logistical fleets.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-specialize-2",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Whether you’re looking at the LT® Series for long-haul efficiency, the HX® Series for severe-duty performance, or the MV® Series for local delivery and utility work, we’ll help you find the best fit for your operation, workload, and budget.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "cards-specialize-3",
                  "type": "card-lists",
                  "props": {
                    "variant": "series",
                    "items": [
                      {
                        "title": "LT® SERIES",
                        "intro": "Long-haul efficiency",
                        "points": []
                      },
                      {
                        "title": "HX® SERIES",
                        "intro": "Severe-duty performance",
                        "points": []
                      },
                      {
                        "title": "MV® SERIES",
                        "intro": "Local delivery and utility work",
                        "points": []
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-uptime",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "We’re Focused on Your Uptime",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "uptime"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-uptime-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Trucks don’t make money when they’re sitting still. That’s why we’ve built our dealership around one simple goal: keep your fleet on the road and performing at its best. Our certified service center is staffed by experienced technicians who understand <a href=\"https://www.international.com/\">International trucks</a> inside and out. We use genuine OEM parts, offer 24/7 roadside assistance through International’s network, and prioritize uptime in everything we do. From routine maintenance to emergency repairs, you’re covered fast and efficiently.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-uptime-2",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "We also offer OnCommand® Connection, International’s advanced telematics platform, to give your team access to real-time diagnostics and predictive maintenance insights.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-inventory",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "A Full Inventory of New and Used Trucks",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "inventory"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-inventory-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "When you walk into <a href=\"/\">Sun State International</a>, you’re not browsing a handful of options. We offer a wide selection of both new and used International trucks, ready to meet the needs of fleets of every size. Looking for a <a href=\"/store/inventory?condition=new\">brand-new, fuel-efficient long-hauler</a>? We’ve got you covered. Need a pre-owned truck to round out your fleet? We have <a href=\"/store/inventory?condition=used\">used inventory</a> backed by expert guidance and transparent pricing. Our goal is to give you options, not push a single solution. You tell us your goals, and we’ll find the truck that makes the most sense for your business.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "links-inventory-2",
                  "type": "link-cards",
                  "props": {
                    "across": "2",
                    "items": [
                      {
                        "label": "NEW",
                        "title": "New Trucks →",
                        "url": "/store/inventory?condition=new",
                        "newTab": false
                      },
                      {
                        "label": "PRE-OWNED",
                        "title": "Used Trucks →",
                        "url": "/store/inventory?condition=used",
                        "newTab": false
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-financing",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Flexible Financing That Works for Your Business",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "financing"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-financing-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "We understand that buying a truck is a major investment, and not every business is in the same place financially. That’s why we offer custom financing solutions designed to meet your needs. Whether you’re a first-time owner-operator or managing a multi-unit upgrade, we’ll help you explore financing, leasing, and extended warranty options that fit your timeline and cash flow. <a href=\"/financing\">Our finance team</a> works closely with lenders to ensure you get competitive terms and a plan that keeps your business moving forward.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "co-financing-2-row",
                  "type": "row",
                  "props": {
                    "gap": 0
                  },
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "id": "co-financing-2",
                      "type": "column",
                      "props": {
                        "span": 12
                      },
                      "styles": {
                        "base": {
                          "borderWidth": 1,
                          "borderStyle": "solid",
                          "borderColor": "line",
                          "paddingTop": 26,
                          "paddingRight": 28,
                          "paddingBottom": 26,
                          "paddingLeft": 28,
                          "marginTop": 8,
                          "marginBottom": 34
                        }
                      },
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "id": "co-financing-2-body",
                          "type": "text",
                          "props": {
                            "text": "Need help exploring <a href=\"/financing\">financing</a> or trade-in options? Our team is here to help — <a href=\"/contact\">schedule a consultation today</a>.",
                            "align": "left",
                            "width": "full"
                          },
                          "styles": {
                            "base": {
                              "fontSize": 15,
                              "lineHeight": 1.7,
                              "marginBottom": 12
                            }
                          }
                        },
                        {
                          "id": "co-financing-2-cta",
                          "type": "buttons",
                          "props": {
                            "align": "left",
                            "items": [
                              {
                                "ctaId": "contact-us",
                                "label": "Schedule a Consultation →",
                                "style": "link"
                              }
                            ]
                          }
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-relationships",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "A Reputation Built on Relationships",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "relationships"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-relationships-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "At <a href=\"/\">Sun State International</a>, we’re not here to make a quick sale—we’re here to build long-term relationships with the businesses we serve. We’re a family-owned operation with a strong commitment to service, honesty, and support. We believe in doing business the right way: clear communication, reliable follow-through, and always putting the customer first. That’s what makes our customers keep coming back and why so many fleet owners choose Sun State as their <a href=\"/\">trusted International truck dealer</a>.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-network",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Local Support, Backed by a National Network",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "network"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-network-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "We might be based in Florida, but when you partner with <a href=\"/\">Sun State</a>, you’re backed by <a href=\"https://www.international.com/\">International</a>’s nationwide dealer network. That means whether you’re operating regionally or across state lines, you’ll always have access to certified service, warranty support, and roadside assistance when you need it most.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-trusted-dealer",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Your Trusted International Truck Dealer Is Right Here",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "trusted-dealer"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-trusted-dealer-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "When you’re searching for a dependable <a href=\"/\">International truck dealer</a>, don’t settle for average. At <a href=\"/\">Sun State International</a>, we offer the inventory, expertise, and support to keep your fleet running strong, mile after mile and year after year. From helping you find the right truck to keeping it on the road, we’re with you every step of the way. That’s the Sun State difference. Ready to upgrade your fleet with confidence? <a href=\"/contact\">Reach out to Sun State International</a> now and let’s get started.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "actions-trusted-dealer-2",
                  "type": "buttons",
                  "props": {
                    "align": "left",
                    "items": [
                      {
                        "ctaId": "contact-us",
                        "label": "Get a Quote"
                      },
                      {
                        "ctaId": "browse-new-trucks",
                        "label": "See Our Inventory",
                        "style": "secondary"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
